OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCold and crisp start, with
OL,6,Fplenty of sunshine, although a little
OL,7,Fcloudier for some coastal areas. Some
OL,8,Fcloud could build through the day,
OL,9,Fhowever it will stay dry and sunny for
OL,10,Fmost. Feeling cold with a chilly
OL,11,Fbreezy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSome thin cloud likely
OL,14,Fovernight, but also occasional clear
OL,15,Fspells. Staying cold with a widespread
OL,16,Ffrost and light winds. Perhaps the odd
OL,17,Fpatch of freezing fog developing in
OL,18,Fprone spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
