OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAnother largely fine day,
OL,6,Fwith some brighter or sunny spells,
OL,7,Fbut likely cloudier than on Friday.
OL,8,FThis will lead to a rather cold feel,
OL,9,Fespecially in the developing breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLess
OL,12,Fcold on Sunday and Monday, but also
OL,13,Fturning changeable with spells of rain
OL,14,Falong with drier and brighter
OL,15,Fintervals. Unsettled on Tuesday,
OL,16,Fperhaps with more persistent rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
